[Rocq] A [tactic modifier](/journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/tactic-modifier) in Rocq:(/journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/rocq) that destructures [hypothesis](/journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/hypothesis)es as they're introduced (like `intros [x y]` to unpack a pair or `intros [H|H]` for a disjunction).
